.\" cflow.1 -- maux's stub for the POSIX cflow(1) utility, which
.\" this tree does not provide. An original page (this project's own
.\" text), so it carries no third-party notice -- MIT like the code,
.\" same posture as env.1/man.1. Recorded in docs/POSIX-GAPS.md sec
.\" 5 ("Not applicable, and why") so the omission is not re-
.\" litigated. Rendered at build time to build/man/CFLOW.TXT and
.\" staged on the play image as /usr/man/CFLOW.
.TH CFLOW 1 "September 17, 2026" maux
.SH NAME
cflow \- generate a C-flow graph
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Cflow
is not provided on maux.
there is no C compiler on maux; nas(1), as(1), and ld(1) are
this system's own assemble-and-link toolchain.
